The delivery proof a cut card is judged against (src/deferrallog.ts)

deliveredFollowupTokens answers "was ANY follow-up card for this token
delivered?". A duplicate needs a sharper question: "was a card delivered at or
AFTER the attempt I am about to re-send?" Only the entry's own stamp can answer
that, and an entry without a usable stamp proves nothing — which re-sends the
card, the never-miss direction.

